    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Turley Property Advisors are proud to present No. 6 Quartz, The Grange to the market for sale by private treaty.  A beautifully appointed one-bedroom apartment conveniently located on the first floor of this superb development which offers generous proportions and the convenience of a 24-hour concierge service within this popular apartment complex that is located off the N11 – close to Stillorgan and Blackrock Villages. \r\n\r\nThe apartment boasts floor-to-ceiling windows in both the living area and bedroom, flooding the space with natural light and offering direct access to a balcony—perfect for enjoying long evenings or entertaining guests. Whether you're a first-time buyer, investor, or looking to downsize without compromise, this property is ready—simply hang up your hat and settle in.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 50 sq.m /540 sq ft, this apartment offers a well-considered balance of living and bedroom space. A welcoming entrance hall leads into a spacious living room featuring underfloor heating and full-height glazing—creating a bright, inviting atmosphere. Off the living area lies a modern kitchen complete with premium fittings, integrated appliances, and a practical utility area.\r\n\r\nThe bedroom is equally impressive, with large windows, built-in wardrobes, and a serene ambiance—making it the perfect retreat. The large bathroom is stylishly finished with a bath tub. \r\n\r\nThe apartment further benefits from an external storage unit housing the gas boiler and secure underground parking space.\r\n\r\nThe Grange offers the best of both convenience and connectivity. Positioned just off the N11 with access to the Quality Bus Corridor (QBC), commuting to Dublin City Centre is seamless. The Luas at Sandyford is just a 10-minute walk, and local amenities abound with Stillorgan Village, Foxrock, Dundrum Town Centre, Leopardstown Racecourse, and UCD Belfield all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nHall Entrance - Tiled flooring and door through to bedroom, living and bathroom. Door to storage. Intercom. \r\n\r\nLiving Room - Wooden style flooring with floor to ceiling windows. Recessed lighting. Door through to the balcony. Opening through to:\r\n\r\nKitchen - Fitted with an extensive array of wall and base units. Integrated appliances – oven/grill, extractor fan, gas hob, fridge freezer, stainless steel sink unit, dishwasher, door to utility room. Tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nUtility Room - With plumbing for washing machine and dryer.\r\n\r\nBathroom - Incorporating w.c, wash hand basin, bath with attachment. Tiled floors and walls.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - Double bedroom with french door to balcony. Carpet. Floor to ceiling windows with an abundance of light. Built in wardrobes."
      },
      {
